invalid type: string "As chairman of the Drafting Committee, B.R. Ambedkar is hailed as the chief architect of the Constitution of India, adopted on 26 November 1949. He championed fundamental rights, abolished untouchability under Article 17, and ensured reservations for Scheduled Castes and Scheduled Tribes. He served as Independent India's first Law Minister from 1947 to 1951.", expected i64rej